model {
  extend basalt.pool {
    metadata {
      constraint "Settings' View all history opens the pool app's declared History page through the host's `page` parameter, the same tab Overview's own History tab shows, so History has one route and Back is the browser's. The pool app no longer posts a back message or renders its own header, tab bar or Back button; the host's older usage-history fragment still opens the App tab, where it now shows the overview. The overview drops its per-model limits and account-limits dialog; banked resets show per lab and kind, and per-model limits and spending stay on the host's Accounts tab; the native presentation journey checks the banked-reset list instead."
    }
  }
}
